dio placeholder.","Access type","sdk","access","section",[74],{"_57":75,"_25":63,"_76":77},"Official Python SDK","note","API client source only; generation model and complete game source are not included.","interactive","demo",[81],{"_57":82,"_25":83,"_76":84},"Sound effects generator","https://elevenlabs.io/sound-effects","Official text-to-audio generator and sound examples; this is an audio tool, not a playable game.","tutorial",[87],{"_57":88,"_25":89,"_76":90},"Sound Effects quickstart","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-api/guides/cookbooks/sound-effects","Official API walkthrough with SDK examples; an account and API key are needed for generation.","Source reviewed","2026-10-19","verified","metadata","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[101,102],"dimensions","2D","3D","Development stages",[106],"stages","Assets & animation","Topics",[110,111,112,113,114,115],"tags","Sound effects","Foley","Ambience","Audio loops","API","Commercial service","Further reading",[118,119],{"_57":122,"_25":123},{"_57":120,"_25":121},"Sound Effects API reference","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/text-to-sound-effects/convert","Product walkthrough","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-creative/playground/sound-effects","Project source",[126],{"_57":124,"_25":127},"https://elevenlabs.io/docs/overview/capabilities/sound-effects","Why it belongs here","Describe footsteps, impacts, UI feedback, or environmental sounds, control duration, and export audio for a game engine. The documentation describes loop-enabled generation for seamless repeat playback and a 30-second maximum per clip. Its overview lists MP3 for all effects and 48 kHz WAV for non-looping effects; API format support and plan requirements should be checked separately. Loop quality still needs validation in the target game. This is a hosted audio service. The public SDK connects to its API and does not release the generation model or a complete game project.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Tool","Category","Game prod